<p>You draw power from the depths of the void causing your Reality Fracture to enhance any existing rifts.</p><p><span style="color: #7f7f7f"><span class="tstr-color-GREY">Void Rift:</span></span> Deals <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 46%, 67%, 84%, 100%</acronym> increased damage and projectiles explode in radius 1.</p><p><span style="color: #80008b"><span class="tstr-color-PURPLE">Nether Breach:</span></span> Deals <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 46%, 67%, 84%, 100%</acronym> increased damage and chains to 3 targets.</p><p><span style="color: #80008b"><span class="tstr-color-PURPLE">Temporal Vortex:</span></span> Deals <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 46%, 67%, 84%, 100%</acronym> increased damage, radius increased by 1, and slow increased to 50%.</p><p><span style="color: #80008b"><span class="tstr-color-PURPLE">Dimensional Gate:</span></span> Voidling Skitterers will be frenzied, increasing their global speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 46%, 67%, 84%, 100%.</acronym></p>